├── tests/
│   ├── test_utils.py         # Unit tests
│   └── test_sync.py          # Integration tests
└── venv/                     # Virtual environment (gitignored)
```

## Quick Reference

### Run Script
```bash
source venv/bin/activate
python "update-mp3-metadata.py" /path/to/music
```

### Dry-Run (Preview)
```bash
python "update-mp3-metadata.py" --dry-run /path/to/music
```

### Rollback
```bash
python "update-mp3-metadata.py" --rollback changes_TIMESTAMP.json
```

### Run Tests
```bash
pytest -q
```

### Install Dependencies
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
brew install chromaprint  # macOS only
```

## Remember
- **Data integrity is paramount** - never risk losing user files
- **Test everything** - run pytest after changes
- **Document everything** - update README.md and ISSUES.md
- **Verify checksums** - ensure file content preserved
- **Log changes** - enable rollback capability
